    IMPORTING
      text                     TYPE clike
      duration                 TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      width                    TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      my                       TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      at                       TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      of                       TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      offset                   TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
      collision                TYPE clike     OPTIONAL
